<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 18/21.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 18/21.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, April 21 on Friday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   21.04.97	  18.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5292	    6.4996</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3296	    2.3182</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5536	    4.5280</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1726	    3.1892</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5191	    0.5186</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7709	    0.7727</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2912	   0.2899</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8758	    6.8853</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6960	    0.6954</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2752	    1.2761</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
